h" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97.png 720w" width="700"/></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-43d68648-f0dd-421b-981d-0f1116d81e1a"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/content-and-digital-communications-lead/">Content and Digital Communications Lead</a></h4>\n<p><em>The application deadline for this role has passed. Those moving forward in the process will be contacted directly. </em></p>\n<hr/>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-43d68648-f0dd-421b-981d-0f1116d81e1a"></h4>\n<hr/>\n<hr/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-15929" decoding="async" height="900" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png 1600w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-350x197.png 350w" style="width:700px;height:auto" width="1600"/></a></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/"><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6">Georgetown Student Opportunities</span></a><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6"> </span></h4>\n<p>CSET is hiring for the following student positions: China Emerging Tech Student Research Assistant – <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/georgetown/d/inst/15$158872/9925$42364.htmld">JR24213</a>.  All applications for student employment must be submitted via GMS. More information can be found on our\xa0Student Opportunities<a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp/wp-admin/post.php?post=6329&amp;action=edit"> page</a>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Culture Statement</h3>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized" id="Culture-Statement"><a href="#Culture-Statement"><img alt="" class="wp-image-17006" decoding="async" height="3300" sizes="(max-width: 2550px) 100vw, 2550px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png 2550w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-250x324.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-700x906.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-768x994.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1187x1536.png 1187w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1583x2048.png 1583w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-120x155.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-116x150.png 116w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-270x350.png 270w" style="width:1078px;height:auto" width="2550"/></a></figure>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Resources</span> </h3>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">FAQ’s:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nD6Y9mytlMJBvfIDUZI45NtwQ3ASC14WzfJqZTEDcqg/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P6mGbiNs7OihHHS1Y7i2_sHgPmZch_L_wdMy0o6rqeo/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Fellow FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">Previous hiring info session recordings:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-hiring-info-session/">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst Hiring Info Session</a> (2/10/22)</li>\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-research-fellow-hiring-info-session/">Research Fellow Hiring Info Session</a> (8/4/22)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Contact Us</span> </h3>\n<p>For all inquiries related to current job openings, please contact us at <a href="mailto:csetcareers@georgetown.edu">csetcareers@georgetown.edu</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class="l-postscript">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
