t Suniva and SolarWorld claim their trade case will create more than 114,800 jobs">\n <span>Print</span>\n</a>\n<div class="share-buttons" id="share-buttons">\n<ul aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Share Buttons" class="share-buttons__modal">\n<li>\n<a class="share-buttons__link email" href="mailto:?subject=Site%20R%20Street%20Institute%20%3A%20Suniva%2520and%2520SolarWorld%2520claim%2520their%2520trade%2520case%2520will%2520create%2520more%2520than%2520114%2C800%2520jobs&amp;body=Event%20about%3A%20Suniva%2520and%2520SolarWorld%2520claim%2520their%2520trade%2520case%2520will%2520create%2520more%2520than%2520114%2C800%2520jobslink%20to%20eventhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.rstreet.org%252Fcommentary%252Fsuniva-and-solarworld-claim-their-trade-case-will-create-more-than-114800-jobs%252F" rel="nofollow" tabindex="-1" title="Share via Email: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs">\n<span class="screen-reader-text">Share via Email: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs</span>\n<i class="far fa-envelope"></i>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class="share-buttons__link facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rstreet.org%2Fcommentary%2Fsuniva-and-solarworld-claim-their-trade-case-will-create-more-than-114800-jobs%2F" rel="nofollow" tabindex="-1" title="Share via Facebook: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs">\n<span class="screen-reader-text">Share via Facebook: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs</span>\n<i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class="share-buttons__link twitter" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rstreet.org%2Fcommentary%2Fsuniva-and-solarworld-claim-their-trade-case-will-create-more-than-114800-jobs%2F&amp;via=RSI" rel="nofollow" tabindex="-1" title="Share via Twitter: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs">\n<span class="screen-reader-text">Share via Twitter: Suniva%20and%20SolarWorld%20claim%20their%20trade%20case%20will%20create%20more%20than%20114,800%20jobs</span>\n<i class="fab fa-twitter"></i>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<a aria-expanded="false" class="share-buttons__button button transparent-blue-button" href="javascript:void(0);" role="button" tabindex="0">\n <span>Share</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="article-header__bottom-meta">\n<div class="article-header__issues">\n<span>issues: </span>\n<a href="https://www.rstreet.org/issues/clean-energy/">Clean Energy</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/energy-and-environment/">Energy and Environment</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/finance-and-trade/">Finance and Trade</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/issues/trade/">Trade</a> </div>\n<div class="article-header__source">\n<span>originally published in </span>\n<a href="https://www.greentechmedia.com/articles/read/suniva-solarworld-claim-trade-case-will-create-more-than-114800-jobs">Greentech Media</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class="article-header__stamp">\n </figure>\n</section>\n<section class="key-points alignnone" id="block-cb750367823a3341416bab0cc60c989a">\n</section>\nFrom <a href="https://www.greentechmedia.com/articles/read/suniva-solarworld-claim-trade-case-will-create-more-than-114800-jobs">Greentech Media</a>:</p>\n<blockquote><p>Conservative political groups The Heritage Foundation, the R Street Institute and the American Legislative Exchange Council have also\xa0<a href="https://www.greentechmedia.com/articles/read/conservative-groups-oppose-suniva-solarworld-trade-case">criticized the trade petition</a>\xa0as a “a step backward” and “the worst kind of protectionism.” The three groups recently joined SEIA and others as members of ETAC.</p></blockquote>\n<p><section class="publication-slider alignfull" id="block-f53cbe4628a8f68cd42badf58746a580">\n<div class="container">\n<div class="publication-slider__heading-row">\n<h2 class="publication-slider__subtitle kicker">Featured Publications</h2>\n</div>\n<div class="publication-slider__wrap wow animate__animated animate__fadeInRight">\n<div class="publication-slider__grid grid 1">\n<article class="grid-post column">\n<div class="grid-post__thumb-wrap"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/commentary/its-time-for-congress-to-treat-ride-share-platforms-like-peer-companies/"><img alt="" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" decoding="async" height="426" loading="lazy" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" src="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-1024x682.jpg" srcset="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-1621x1080.jpg 1621w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AdobeStock_294951832-copy-765x510.jpg 765w" width="640"/></a></div> <div class="grid-post__content">\n<div class="grid-post__top-meta">\n<span class="grid-post__types">Analysis</span> <span class="grid-post__areas"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/federal-government-affairs/">Federal Government Affairs</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/finance-and-trade/">Finance and Trade</a>, 